# clasp push allowlist for kos-personal.
#
# clasp's default behavior recurses through the whole rootDir, and this
# directory has a whole separate Node.js service (inference-service/) and
# other non-script material (docs, tests) that must never reach the live
# Apps Script project. (This used to also cover legacy/archived subfolders
# from three rounds of reupload reconciliation — removed in the external
# product review's dead-code cleanup, see kos-personal/CHANGELOG.md Round
# 13 — but the allowlist-not-denylist approach below is what actually
# stopped those from ever reaching a push, and stays the right default for
# whatever shows up here next.) Rather than deny-list each new addition,
# this ignores everything by default and explicitly un-ignores only the
# files that are actually part of the live bound project.
**/**

!appsscript.json
!1_Config_And_Deploy.gs
!2_Ingestion_Sensors.gs
!3_Queue_Processor.gs
!4_Vector_Router.gs
!5_Error_And_Utilities.gs
!6_Governance.gs
!7_WebApp.gs
!8_WebApp_UI.html
!9_UI_Diagnostics.gs
!10_Turnstile.gs
!11_Registrar_CogRelay.gs
